  "comment": "CAMBRA v0.98.0 — final 30/33 verified repository package. Spain is active; France, Belgium and the Netherlands remain activation-protected and research-visible. The complete founder corpus is fixed at 11 physical originals, 9 SHA-unique documents and 2 exact duplicates, all quarantined as unverified/non-executable/non-training evidence. The release pipeline is reproducible and each emitted ZIP is cryptographically self-verifiable for its exact gate execution; evidence timestamps mean independent reruns are not claimed byte-identical. productionSealEligible remains false: every OTR is NOT_MET, all eight root seals are NOT_SEALED, and no deploy, live provider drill, runtime purge or production mutation is claimed.",
